---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import itsonLogo from '../../assets/itson-logo.png';
---

<section
    class="bg-brand-secondary sticky top-0 z-0 flex min-h-screen w-full items-center px-6 py-12 text-white md:px-20">
    <div
        class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-7xl flex-col gap-12 md:flex-row md:items-stretch md:gap-16 lg:gap-24">
        <div class="flex flex-none flex-col md:w-1/3">
            <h2 class="text-7xl leading-none font-bold tracking-wide md:text-8xl lg:text-[9rem]">
                <span class="block">About</span>
                <span class="block">us</span>
            </h2>

            <div class="mt-8 md:mt-12 lg:mt-16">
                <Image
                    src={itsonLogo}
                    alt="ITSON Universidad"
                    class="h-12 w-auto object-contain opacity-90 md:h-16"
                />
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex-1 border-l pl-8 md:pl-12 lg:pl-16">
            <div class="space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed md:text-lg lg:text-xl">
                <p>
                    ACISLAB is an interdisciplinary research laboratory at the Instituto Tecnológico
                    de Sonora (ITSON) dedicated to advancing the fields of Affective Computing and
                    Health Informatics.
                </p>
                <p>Our efforts focus on generating novel knowledge useful to design and build:</p>

                <ol class="list-inside list-[upper-alpha] space-y-5 pl-4">
                    <li class="pl-2">
                        Intelligent systems that not only optimize tasks but are also capable of
                        understanding, modeling, and responding to the human cognitive and emotional
                        condition.
                    </li>
                    <li class="pl-2">
                        Computing systems that enhance the well-being of People with Dementia and
                        their caregivers in real-world settings.
                    </li>
                </ol>

                <p>
                    We follow an interdisciplinary approach, working with researchers who study
                    human behavior, healthcare professionals, and engineers to turn theory into
                    real-world impact. At ACISLAB, we foster a collaborative environment where
                    undergraduate and graduate students work side-by-side on academic and applied
                    projects.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
